WEBVTT

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:11.262
-Whoa.
-(excited chatter)

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:12.555
-That is so cool!
-Yeah.

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:13.890
-Ooh.
-(whooping, cheering)

00:00:13.973 --> 00:00:15.433
(grunting)

00:00:15.516 --> 00:00:17.852
-Ooh.
-Whoa! Careful.

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.562
Yeah!

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:21.689
Wahoo!

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.819
(grunts)

00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:28.696
Here, try this.

00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:31.699
(grunting)

00:00:31.782 --> 00:00:32.909
Seriously?

00:00:32.992 --> 00:00:35.495
I look ridiculous.

00:00:35.578 --> 00:00:36.829
FRANK:
Keep your shirt on, pal.

00:00:36.913 --> 00:00:39.373
We've seen more than enough of you.

00:00:39.457 --> 00:00:41.042
Me, on the other hand--

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:43.920
easy on the eyes.

00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:46.255
-Ugh, please.
-Coming through!

00:00:46.339 --> 00:00:47.673
-Wendell, get down from there.
-(wolf pups clamoring)

00:00:47.757 --> 00:00:49.258
Wally, sweetie, uh-uh, don't touch that.

00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:51.219
-Wendy, no. Put that down.
-(belching)

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:53.971
Ow. Wesley, what did I just-- Huh?

00:00:54.055 --> 00:00:55.181
Oops.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:56.682
(chuckles)

00:00:56.766 --> 00:00:57.892
My bad.

00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.101
Whoa!

00:00:59.185 --> 00:01:00.311
Hey!

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:01.604
Do not make me come back there!

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:03.397
I will turn this blimp around!

00:01:03.481 --> 00:01:04.941
ALL (in unison):
Sorry, Ericka.

00:01:05.024 --> 00:01:08.319
Sorry, I didn't think leaving them
at a monster hotel would be safe.

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:11.906
Guess I didn't realize
your blimp would be such a, uh...

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:13.324
A monster-killing machine?

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:15.409
(scoffs) What? No.

00:01:15.493 --> 00:01:17.453
-(alarm buzzes)
-Whoa!

00:01:17.537 --> 00:01:18.538
(panting)

00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:20.498
Okay. Yeah, it's a death trap.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:23.793
Yeah. Sorry about that. (chuckles)

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:26.796
All this-- this is the old me.

00:01:26.879 --> 00:01:29.590
Your dad helped me leave that all behind.

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:33.219
I hope he's okay.

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:35.555
Don't worry. We're gonna find them.

00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:39.308
♪ ♪

00:01:59.245 --> 00:02:00.246
(excited chatter)

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:02.415
Okay, guys, we've made it.

00:02:02.498 --> 00:02:03.666
OTHERS:
Whoa!

00:02:03.749 --> 00:02:05.501
It's enormous.

00:02:05.585 --> 00:02:07.753
How we gonna find them in there?

00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:11.340
I think I have an idea.

00:02:11.424 --> 00:02:14.385
♪ ♪

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:16.887
Well, we're gonna have to take
this search to the ground.

00:02:16.971 --> 00:02:19.056
I have just the thing.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:20.224
(engine revving)

00:02:20.308 --> 00:02:22.977
-(screaming)
-(excited chatter, laughing)

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:28.649
(whooping)

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:32.445
(excited chatter)

00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:35.239
(screaming, whooping)

00:02:35.323 --> 00:02:37.074
(grunts) Oh, my hair!

00:02:37.158 --> 00:02:39.243
-(chuckles): Oh, my hair.
-(camera clicks)

00:02:39.327 --> 00:02:40.411
(screams)

00:02:40.494 --> 00:02:41.912
Where's Blobby?!

00:02:43.247 --> 00:02:45.082
Okay, Mavis, what's the plan?

00:02:46.083 --> 00:02:47.209
(grunts)

00:02:49.962 --> 00:02:51.714
(ears pinging)

00:02:51.797 --> 00:02:53.174
JOHNNY:
♪ Just the two of us ♪

00:02:53.257 --> 00:02:56.052
♪ Father and son-in-law. ♪

00:02:56.135 --> 00:02:57.345
Got 'em.

00:02:57.428 --> 00:02:58.596
That way!

00:03:00.056 --> 00:03:02.058
(screaming)

00:03:05.936 --> 00:03:07.938
(Dracula groaning softly)

00:03:10.149 --> 00:03:11.692
(groaning)

00:03:11.776 --> 00:03:13.319
(wind whistling)

00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:15.863
(muttering)

00:03:15.946 --> 00:03:17.948
(groaning)

00:03:19.241 --> 00:03:22.203
Oh! My head!

00:03:22.286 --> 00:03:25.081
What? What's going on?

00:03:25.164 --> 00:03:26.499
Have a good nap?

00:03:26.582 --> 00:03:29.919
Nap? You slapped me so hard
I lost consciousness!

00:03:30.002 --> 00:03:32.088
But I did get that mosquito.

00:03:32.171 --> 00:03:34.507
Hey, where are we?

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:36.050
-Just following the ping.
-(steady beeping)

00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:37.176
Let me see that.

00:03:38.844 --> 00:03:40.429
Okay.

00:03:40.513 --> 00:03:42.723
It seems like we're going
in the right direction.

00:03:42.807 --> 00:03:44.308
-(static crackling)
-Huh?

00:03:44.392 --> 00:03:46.268
Wh-What's going on?

00:03:46.352 --> 00:03:48.229
Oh, what's wrong with this thing?

00:03:48.312 --> 00:03:50.147
We lost the signal.

00:03:50.231 --> 00:03:52.316
-Why would it just-- (whimpers)
-Whoops!

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:54.318
(echoing):
Whoa.

00:03:54.402 --> 00:03:55.986
(wind whistling)

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.488
(hawk screeches)

00:03:57.571 --> 00:04:00.491
Huh. I think we took a wrong turn.

00:04:00.574 --> 00:04:01.575
(frustrated grunt)

00:04:01.659 --> 00:04:03.244
You took a wrong turn!

00:04:03.327 --> 00:04:05.162
I can't trust you to do anything right!

00:04:05.246 --> 00:04:07.540
Now put me down!

00:04:07.623 --> 00:04:09.333
-No, Drac. Hey. Hey.
-Get your claws off me!

00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:10.710
-We're really high up. Whoa.
-(grunting)

00:04:10.793 --> 00:04:11.877
-Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hey!
-Put me down! Put me down!

00:04:11.961 --> 00:04:12.962
-Whoa, whoa, whoa!
-Put me-- (screams)

00:04:13.045 --> 00:04:14.630
Drac! (screams)

00:04:14.714 --> 00:04:15.840
(both grunt, scream)

00:04:15.923 --> 00:04:17.925
(distant screaming)

00:04:20.511 --> 00:04:23.305
(frantic screaming)

00:04:23.389 --> 00:04:25.349
(distant screaming)

00:04:26.517 --> 00:04:27.893
(frantic screaming)

00:04:27.977 --> 00:04:29.353
(grunting)

00:04:29.437 --> 00:04:30.730
Ow, ow, ee!

00:04:30.813 --> 00:04:32.815
-Johnny, your tail!
-Ah, sorry!

00:04:32.898 --> 00:04:34.275
Your foot!

00:04:34.358 --> 00:04:35.401
(screaming)

00:04:35.484 --> 00:04:36.569
(grunting)

00:04:36.652 --> 00:04:38.237
Your wings, Johnny!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.321
Wings?

00:04:39.405 --> 00:04:41.198
Johnny! You've got wings!

00:04:41.282 --> 00:04:42.825
Flap, Johnny, flap!

00:04:42.908 --> 00:04:44.452
(panicked grunting)

00:04:44.535 --> 00:04:46.245
-Fly!
-I can't! I can't!

00:04:46.328 --> 00:04:47.788
Drac, what do we do?!

00:04:47.872 --> 00:04:49.707
-Drac!
-Johnny, Johnny, calm down!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.877
-Can you wiggle your nose?
-Uh-huh.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.588
-Wiggle your toes.
-Okay.

00:04:55.671 --> 00:04:57.548
Flap your wings!

00:04:57.631 --> 00:04:58.966
(straining)

00:04:59.049 --> 00:05:00.718
I... I-I can't.

00:05:00.801 --> 00:05:01.969
I can't do it.

00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:04.305
You're doing it, Johnny!

00:05:04.388 --> 00:05:07.391
You're flying!

00:05:07.475 --> 00:05:10.102
What? I'm-I'm flying?

00:05:10.186 --> 00:05:12.104
I'm flying!

00:05:12.188 --> 00:05:13.481
(whoops)

00:05:13.564 --> 00:05:15.649
I did it, Drac!

00:05:15.733 --> 00:05:16.734
Drac?

00:05:16.817 --> 00:05:18.319
(Dracula screaming)

